A writer fiber that pushes a fresh list onto a list of lists in a cell, or inserts one into a `Dict` of lists, and a loan of an element read after a push onto the outer list (#2594). The row of `Ref.update` hands the function each part of the contents at its place, so the push writes the outer storage, not the elements: each write is accepted and runs in place (ownership-v3-kernel.md §13 item 2, amended 2026-11-22). Its live twin is CellWriterStoresFreshLive, which also holds the fold, refused on the pessimistic side (#2698).
